{"file_name": "store-2-factory.png", "id": "1000345199614941", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499624583_1000345202948274_3714007804450407580_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uGRzoeO8_4kQ7kNvwENXZMW&_nc_oc=AdrWDpE-lqTaDVtIqzDdFpl5SOpRhod89NBNbXVbYzLxyiePRXqKG2sh10Ax74BoFeM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRcZ-g2VZuCOjm-ojE4UT7YKPfKVaJYxhJfoodDVcqiXQ&oe=6B05A25B"}, {"file_name": "store-3-robot-shop.png", "id": "1668313561395617", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499628454_1668313564728950_3842695006588611594_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=K7emrR_sMtcQ7kNvwHliOLN&_nc_oc=Adr46NB1Oxd7ceHbripEC6VW6aMsjM_NlC-e536qsU0079GOcKgyW8d0WINO3nJk3WA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ5yo2I9WKGw35bsbtH3dPJIuNkVEkGzLOjfmzbksFUKw&oe=6B05D1F3"}, {"file_name": "store-4-friends.png", "id": "1631513835420536", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619369_1631513838753869_4313290777978830439_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iY16jUG1OroQ7kNvwEOzu7C&_nc_oc=AdoJjcgbDUklc4LOxGx5rx0wUl8cyu7Zyq6a_1zOwIOjFapoh8KqYQWMBE_P5JPiRc8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRJsFdZ4ZCL8OM1PHyqNkmpwJ_FGJ9fmM-EselfC-OMiw&oe=6B05A2DE"}, {"file_name": "store-5-rebuild.png", "id": "1628295938993203", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620630_1628295942326536_5880039889540522475_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_Bjy-xqMMjMQ7kNvwEMsu8f&_nc_oc=AdoKWm9535eq6lxLnzQLbUwo7X9Ausb9oTCZBGtdFgPuheL2VpLjFoI7Kn-YcsE563s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSnu1AxkV1MrsJELQQYZvaKo0RjcK0eSuXKgdhENUM85g&oe=6B05B7F1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Bonk Slop", "keywords": ["gorilla", "multiplayer", "portals", "robots"], "long_description": "**Move like a gorilla.** No thumbsticks: push off the ground with your hands to run, climb walls and launch yourself through the air.\n\n**Bonk everything.** Punch friends and monsters, grab and throw stuff, ride shopping carts and tear walls off houses.\n\n**A whole world to mess around in**\n- Bonk Town: shops, houses, townsfolk and a bank\n- The Mining Cave: dig ore and gold, sell it at Dave's Shop, buy better gear\n- The Forgotten Factory: four floors of deformed monsters and loot\n- Giant robots, a Titan, and a showdown boss fight\n\n**Portals you can see through.** Become a portal-hopping mad scientist and open seamless portals: look through them, reach your arms in, and walk out somewhere else.\n\n**Play together.** Online rooms for up to five players with public matchmaking or private codes, or play solo.\n\nMade by a solo developer who is learning to code.", "short_description": "Swing your arms to run, climb and fling yourself around as a gorilla in Bonk Slop, a goofy VR brawler. Bonk your friends across town, mine the cave for gold, survive the Forgotten Factory's monsters, pilot giant robots, and hop through real see-through portals as a mad scientist. Play solo or online with up to five players."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://dummonk1403.github.io/bonk-slop/#privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Amazing Gorilla", "support_website_url": "https://github.com/Dummonk1403/bonk-slop/issues", "website_url": "https://dummonk1403.github.io/bonk-slop/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER", "MULTI_USER"], "id": "1983294882347338"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2579583032545599"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2579583032545599"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1793399460, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2579583032545599"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2025049194838573", "version": "2.68"}, "id": "2359923834780302", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1983294875680672", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "2025049194838573"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2359923834780302"}]}, "change_log": "NEW\n- Punching is remade: squeeze grip + trigger to make a fist and swing. A hit lands when your fist really touches the target\n- Hooks and uppercuts count, not only straight punches\n- Hits feel harder: a stronger controller jolt, an impact sound and a burst\n- Everyone in the room sees the player who got hit flash\n\nFIXES\n- Punches no longer miss oil barrels and other solid targets\n- No more hitting through walls\n- One swing is one hit: no second hit when you pull your hand back\n- An arm the monster tore off can't punch. Your other arm still can", "created_date": 1795155906, "id": "2025049194838573", "version": "2.68", "version_code": 123, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1983294875680672", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "2025049194838573"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2359923834780302"}]}, "change_log": "FIXED\n- Be the Monster: tearing is much easier. Arms, heads and bodies come off after a shorter hold and a smaller pull.\n- A monster's grab now works even if you squeeze a moment before your hand reaches the survivor.", "created_date": 1795146835, "id": "2024952011514958", "version": "2.67", "version_code": 122, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1983294875680672", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "2025049194838573"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2359923834780302"}]}, "change_log": "NEW\n- Be the Monster: monsters can rip a survivor's arm off. A torn-off arm can't move you, grab or use items until you respawn, so get around with the other one.\n- Monsters can tear a survivor in two at any angle: across, diagonally or straight down.\n- A little blood: a few small red drops, and the insides are red.\n- As the monster, you hear the survivors' voices high pitched.\n\nFIXED\n- John stands on his legs again.\n- The red cap where an arm came off is now the same size as the arm.\n\nEveryone needs this update to play online together.", "created_date": 1795142022, "id": "2024898508186975", "version": "2.66", "version_code": 121, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1983294875680672", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "2025049194838573"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2359923834780302"}]}, "change_log": "NEW\n- Be the Monster: every map now has back rooms and corridors all round it, with cover to hide behind. The monster has to search for you.\n\nFIXED\n- Parts of the map no longer vanish when you turn your head (Be the Monster, the train chambers, the Trap Room and the finale vents).\n- Losing the lobby connection now takes you back to your own room.\n- Two players no longer start on the same spot.\n- The Clanker's claw no longer sinks into the floor.\n- A Ground Slam started in the air no longer leaves the Clanker hovering.\n- John's crouch now really makes him lower.\n\nEveryone needs this update to play online together.", "created_date": 1795064429, "id": "2024026194940873", "version": "2.65", "version_code": 120, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1983294875680672", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "2025049194838573"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2359923834780302"}]}, "change_log": "NEW\n- Be the Monster: a new mode. Take the PLAY sign in the spawn house to a lobby of up to 10 players, then pick One Monster, Two Monsters or Infection.\n- Three maps, each with an upper floor: the Glasshouse (open three valves), the Broadcast Station (find three signal cards, then pull the lever) and Junk Harbor (carry three batteries to the truck).\n- Three monsters: The Clanker (free: Ground Slam and Scrap Sense), John (5 Gold Bonk Coins + 3,000 Bonk Coins: Dark Time) and The Prototype (bundle: Chest Core and Fake Player). The Clanker and The Prototype move on their hands.\n- Monster hands: punch, grab and throw survivors, or hold one with both hands and pull. Parts pop off like toys.\n- Survivor items: Door Wedge, Shock Puck and Grip Breaker. Each good use pays 250 Bonk Coins.\n- Pick Your Monster room with a spectator screen in the lobby.", "created_date": 1795049202, "id": "2023870521623107", "version": "2.63", "version_code": 118, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}